      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_03",
      "hash64": "C44609AE4D4FFC37",
      "text": "３　对携带不变之石的宝可梦\\n　　使用火之石这类使其进化的道具，\\n　　能不能让宝可梦进化？\\n\\n・能进化　・不能进化",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
