    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_05",
      "hash64": "C44607AE4D4FF8D1",
      "text": "５　花舞鸟这种宝可梦\\n　　一共有３种形态。\\n\\n・正确\\n・不正确",
      "flags": 0,
