      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_a_08_question_06",
      "hash64": "C44604AE4D4FF3B8",
      "text": "☆★本题不计分★☆\\n\\n上了吉尼亚老师的课，有什么感想呢？\\n虽然我还不够熟练，也给大家添了一些麻烦，\\n但我是非常开心能当大家的老师的～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06a",
      "hash64": "1F4DEA9C75D6919A",
      "text": "很开心！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_a_08_ansewer_06b",
      "hash64": "1F4DE99C75D68FE7",
      "text": "谢谢老师！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
